      "seed": 1176988941,
      "version": 573,
      "versionNonce": 278775567,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785568126965,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n\n1. System must create and retrieve ledger accounts \n2. Post double-entry transactions \n3. Query balances \n4. Explain financial history \n5. Preserve immutable history \n6. Support idemopotent requests \n7. Protect concurrent balance changes \n8. Support holds \n9. Execute a transfer saga\n10. Publish events reliably \n11. Reconcile external records \n12. Tokenize synetheic identifers \n13. Provide an operations console \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "6TffqaWXdOz9EJbrvjYb1",
      "originalText": "\n\n\n1. System must create and retrieve ledger accounts \n2. Post double-entry transactions \n3. Query balances \n4. Explain financial history \n5. Preserve immutable history \n6. Support idemopotent requests \n7. Protect concurrent balance changes \n8. Support holds \n9. Execute a transfer saga\n10. Publish events reliably \n11. Reconcile external records \n12. Tokenize synetheic identifers \n13. Provide an operations console \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
